        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BST1003SBRRR, Flower Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis ornate flower pattern large decorative knob is designed as a dummy only. It is used as a door pull or as a door decoration. It may also be used on large furniture such as armoires or cabinets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis style of Large Flower Door Knob were made popular in Europe, where they were often placed in the center of doors as a pull. Cast in solid brass and assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International who are famous for high quality innovational door pull designs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BST01-specifications.gif?v=1704354581\"   width=\"290\" height=\"214\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions BST1003SBRRR Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Boston Series 1 Large Flower Pattern Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 3.31\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 3.54</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.14\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This Door Knob Pull is handmade in the USA when you order it. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Decorative Flower Door Knob | Boston Knob",
                "description": "This ornate flower pattern large decorative knob is designed as a dummy only. It is used as a door pull or as a door decoration. It may also be used on large furniture such as armoires or cabinets. This style of Large Flower Door Knob were made popular in Europe, where they were often placed in the center of doors as a pull. Cast in solid brass and assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International who are famous for high quality innovational door pull designs.",
